WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
A lone exploration ship approaches the black star.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The captain’s visor reflects the icy blue ring.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Alone in an escape capsule, he watches the darkness.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.042
The presence is waiting in the room.

5
00:00:15.042 --> 00:00:18.083
Snow falls over a quiet street beneath an unfamiliar sky.